            "\\myparagraph{Action Space} We design a simple Wikipedia web API with three types of actions to support interactive information retrieval: \n",
            "(1) \\textbf{\\texttt{search}}[\\texttt{entity}], which returns the first 5 sentences from the corresponding \\texttt{entity} wiki page if it exists, or else suggests top-5 similar entities from the Wikipedia search engine, \n",
